<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade $0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade $0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Wednesday in a limited test, slaughter steers and heifers sold mostly $0.50 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Few Choice 2-4 1150-1250 lbs 61.00-62.90.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 package 1136 lbs 61.90.</p>
